> How exactly do you do that? How do you make holy water? Is dipping an
> item into holy water the ONLY way to bless it?

There are two ways to make holy water:

1. Drop several potions of water on a coaligned altar and pray while
standing on the altar. Your god will bless the water. This action is
known as a "water prayer".
You may only do this when it is safe to pray, and it causes a prayer
timeout like any other prayer.
2. Read a blessed scroll of remove curse while confused, blessing 25%
of your inventory and cursing 25%. Alternatively, read an uncursed
scroll of remove curse
while wielding a potion of water and confused, which curses 25% of
worn items and blesses another 25%.

As for blessing items, option 2 could also be used to bless items in
the absence of holy water. Your god will also sometimes bless or
rustproof your weapon when you pray with good luck and alignment.



